{"name": "Smash 'N Grab", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"82\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/a592241061fa9449dbe28440187f00bf.avif?t=1787341547\" width=\"392\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Las Vegas. A mob town where every deal is dirty and every light casts a long shadow. After a botched hit leaves Smash, a hulking jazz drum-playing robot, for dead, a cunning raccoon named Grab brings him back to life with a plan: take down the city\u2019s kingpins and reclaim their riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash wants justice. Grab wants the payday. When greed and revenge collide, their partnership may not survive the score...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras_big/b00ad0df93e127a58455dca04aac6dad.avif?t=1787341547\" height=\"912\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/b00ad0df93e127a58455dca04aac6dad.avif?t=1787341547\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"82\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/d127fe9300fba1cfa98158661285b4e7.avif?t=1787341547\" width=\"392\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tear through guards, walls, and breakable objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open up faster paths by smashing your way forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance destruction with speed to maximise your score</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/45153e0093777e56aa8c323b0e9fa121.poster.avif?t=1787341547\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/45153e0093777e56aa8c323b0e9fa121.webm?t=1787341547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/45153e0093777e56aa8c323b0e9fa121.mp4?t=1787341547\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"82\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/dec91add0c7c2c324d75e0404eb7256d.avif?t=1787341547\" width=\"392\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snatch loot, valuables, and hidden diamonds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw enemies and objects to create chaos or clear a path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use clever grabs to uncover shortcuts and boost your run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/43aa6fbb1789831538174f28fd1803e9.poster.avif?t=1787341547\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/43aa6fbb1789831538174f28fd1803e9.webm?t=1787341547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/43aa6fbb1789831538174f28fd1803e9.mp4?t=1787341547\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"82\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/78be7df2d439fd3054d2ba3e3316ba67.avif?t=1787341547\" width=\"392\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race the clock for the perfect heist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master routes, movement, and split-second decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the global leaderboard with faster, higher-scoring runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/c70d36315f5bc6a607fcdbfeea18caa3.poster.avif?t=1787341547\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/c70d36315f5bc6a607fcdbfeea18caa3.webm?t=1787341547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/extras/c70d36315f5bc6a607fcdbfeea18caa3.mp4?t=1787341547\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Smash obstacles, fight guards and zip through the environment as you grab the loot and race against the clock for the perfect heist in this jazzy, noir speedrunning beat \u2019em up!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851460/b92d1dedf4b51d57a311baa850ef1562810ebd9b/header.jpg?t=1787341547", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Beat 'em up", "Score Attack", "Heist", "Arcade", "Destruction", "Noir"], "developers": "SLAP-BANG! Digital", "publishers": "SLAP-BANG! Digital", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3851460", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/QN8YzjIYjzw", "first_seen": 1773705600.0, "review_rank": 956}